@(47 = 47-52) Let me give you a fifth description of my mother: My mother is a palm-tree, with the sweetest fragrance. She is a chariot of juniper wood, a sedan chair of boxwood. She is  @varh[t551.v52]{a fine cloth } @vart[t551.v53,t551.v52]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} a good …… } perfumed with refined oil. She is a bunch of grapes, a garland (?)  @varh[t551.v54]{growing luxuriantly } @vart[t551.v55,t551.v54]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} perfect in luxuriant growth }.  @varh[t551.v56]{She } @vart[t551.v57,t551.v56]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} My mother } is a phial made from an ostrich egg,  @varh[t551.v58]{overflowing } @vart[t551.v59,t551.v58]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} full } with  @varh[t551.v60]{finest } @vart[t551.v61,t551.v60]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} perfumed } oil.  @vart[t551.v62,t551.v62]{@varn{1 ms. adds:} She is a fair woman, accompanied by a protective goddess ……. She is a woman who will show you compassion like (?) @wDN{Aruru}, …… born ……. }

